        rule: { ru: 'I think значит кажется, я думаю. Добавь его перед фразой, чтобы прозвучало мягче: I think you\'re on mute.', uk: 'I think значить здається, я думаю. Додай його перед фразою, щоб звучало м\'якше: I think you\'re on mute.', es: 'I think significa creo. Ponlo antes de la frase para sonar más suave: I think you\'re on mute.' , 'pt-BR': 'I think significa que eu acho. Coloque antes da frase para soar mais suave: I think you\'re on mute.', vi: 'I think có nghĩa là tôi nghĩ. Đặt nó trước cụm từ để nghe nhẹ nhàng hơn: I think you\'re on mute.', id: 'I think artinya menurut saya. Letakkan sebelum frasa agar terdengar lebih lembut: I think you\'re on mute.', tr: 'I think sanırım anlamına geliyor. Daha yumuşak görünmesi için ifadenin önüne koyun: I think you\'re on mute.', pl: 'I think oznacza „myślę”. Umieść go przed frazą, aby brzmiała ciszej: I think you\'re on mute.'},
