        commonMistake: { ru: 'Не говори mean to move. После mean ставь moving: Do you mean moving?', uk: 'Не кажи mean to move. Після mean став moving: Do you mean moving?', es: 'No digas mean to move. Tras mean usa moving: Do you mean moving?' , 'pt-BR': 'Não diga mean para se mudar. Depois de mean usar moving: Do you mean moving?', vi: 'Đừng nói mean để di chuyển. Sau mean sử dụng moving: Do you mean moving?', id: 'Jangan ucapkan mean untuk bergerak. Setelah mean gunakan moving: Do you mean moving?', tr: 'Taşınmak için mean deme. mean sonrasında moving kullanın: Do you mean moving?', pl: 'Nie mów mean, żeby się ruszyć. Po mean użyj moving: Do you mean moving?'},
