      body: {
        ru: 'В жизни люди говорят прямо: this deal is better, the monthly fee is too high, the annual plan saves more money. Не нужно сложных слов — простые сравнения работают хорошо.',
        uk: 'У житті люди говорять прямо: this deal is better, the monthly fee is too high, the annual plan saves more money. Не потрібно складних слів — прості порівняння працюють добре.',
        es: 'En la vida real la gente habla directo: this deal is better, the monthly fee is too high, the annual plan saves more money. No hacen falta palabras complicadas: las comparaciones simples funcionan bien.',
        'pt-BR': 'Na vida real as pessoas falam diretamente: este acordo is better, the monthly fee is too high, the annual plan saves more money. Não há necessidade de palavras sofisticadas: comparações simples funcionam bem.',
        vi: 'Trong cuộc sống thực, mọi người nói thẳng: thỏa thuận này is better, the monthly fee is too high, the annual plan saves more money. Không cần những từ ngữ hoa mỹ: những so sánh đơn giản cũng có hiệu quả.',
        id: 'Dalam kehidupan nyata, orang berbicara secara langsung: kesepakatan ini is better, the monthly fee is too high, the annual plan saves more money. Tidak perlu kata-kata mewah: perbandingan sederhana sudah cukup.',
        tr: 'Gerçek hayatta insanlar doğrudan konuşur: bu anlaşma is better, the monthly fee is too high, the annual plan saves more money. Süslü sözlere gerek yok: basit karşılaştırmalar işe yarar.',
        pl: 'W prawdziwym życiu ludzie mówią bezpośrednio: ta umowa is better, the monthly fee is too high, the annual plan saves more money. Nie potrzeba wymyślnych słów: proste porównania sprawdzają się dobrze.',
      },
